外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"54.6\" width=\"320\" height=\"19.6\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,39.5 9.1,39.6 14.2,62.2 19.3,43.5 24.5,37.7 29.6,50.2 34.7,42.2 39.8,46.9 44.9,54.9 50.0,48.9 55.1,41.4 60.3,48.4 65.4,47.8 70.5,36.4 75.6,38.5 80.7,41.7 85.8,47.3 91.0,42.9 96.1,22.5 101.2,25.0 106.3,20.0 111.4,12.8 116.5,64.1 121.6,72.4 126.8,82.4 131.9,85.7 137.0,72.6 142.1,77.7 147.2,73.4 152.3,90.9 157.4,85.0 162.6,97.2 167.7,90.6 172.8,88.6 177.9,91.2 183.0,84.6 188.1,75.7 193.2,81.2 198.4,82.0 203.5,57.0 208.6,62.1 213.7,57.9 218.8,53.6 223.9,26.1 229.0,46.4 234.2,47.9 239.3,61.2 244.4,39.5 249.5,33.1 254.6,33.0 259.7,37.5 264.9,37.2 270.0,30.1 275.1,41.9 280.2,38.1 285.3,35.8 290.4,27.6 295.5,29.3 300.7,36.3 305.8,35.0 310.9,43.0 316.0,40.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 51.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 14.2 74